    "chunk_text": "wolde, mid lufan & mid ea\u00femodnesse, on menniscne & \u00fea bysena \u00fee hie \u00e6t his d\u00e6dum gesawon, \u00fea hie sceoldan eac mannum cy\u00fean, & his \u00fea halgan \u00de\u00e6t hie ealle heora sylfra eagon oforsegon & heora earon gehyrdon, \u00feyses ealles hie sceoldon Drihtne Swa we leornia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t sona \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee Drihten on heofenas astag, & hie mid Halgan Gaste getrymede & \u00e6ghwylc anra heora in \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6le \u00fee he mid tan geeode, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh Godes gife manige \u00feeode urum Hec cum dixisset usque ad eorum et cetera. Nalas \u00fe\u00e6t wolcn \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fey for\u00fe com \u00fee ure Drihten \u00fe\u00e6s wolcnes fultomes \u00feearfe h\u00e6fde \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re & ealle \u00feurh his godcunde meht & \u00feurh his ecean snyttro \u00e6fter his willan rece\u00fe & stihta\u00fe. & he mid \u00fey tacne swa on \u00fe\u00e6m wolcne from heora gesih\u00fee gewat, & in heofenas astag, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feonne Cumque inturent usque albis. \u00dea hie \u00fea in \u00feone heofon locodan \u00e6fter him, & hie Drihten gesawon upastigendne, \u00fea stodan him \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron Drihtnes englas. \u00dea hwitan hr\u00e6gl \u00feara engla getacnia\u00fe \u00feone gefean engla & manna, \u00fee \u00fea geworden w\u00e6s. For\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t englas on heofenum maran gefean & maran blisse h\u00e6fdon \u00feonne hie \u00deonne w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feas halgan",
